[b]Disclaimer: this mod was made with AI assistance.[/b] If you're not comfortable with that, please stop reading here.

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Signal/images/banner.jpg?v=2[/img]

Radio masts, beacons and signal logs for [b]Build 42[/b]. Talk across the map, leave messages on the air, and listen in on everyone else.

[table]
[tr][td][b]Game version[/b][/td][td]Build 42 only (42.0+)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Requires[/b][/td][td][b]Dazed Core[/b] (subscribe to it too)[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Multiplayer[/b][/td][td]Yes. The server runs every beacon and log[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Add mid-save[/b][/td][td]Yes[/td][/tr]
[tr][td][b]Mod ID[/b][/td][td]DazedSignal[/td][/tr]
[/table]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Signal/images/h-masts.png?v=2[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Signal/images/masts.png?v=2[/img]
[list]
[*]Rooftop antenna, wooden mast, steel mast and lattice tower: 1.5, 2, 4 and 8 times a ham radio's range.
[*]Wire a ham radio to a mast close by. The mast needs power: Dazed Power, the grid or a generator.
[*]Steel masts tell you roughly which way a beacon came from; lattice towers add a rough distance.
[/list]

[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Signal/images/h-beacons.png?v=2[/img]
[img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Dazedgenie/Dazed-Workshop/main/Signal/images/beacons.png?v=2[/img]
[list]
[*]Set a message and call sign on a wired ham and send it once or every few hours. Perfect for trade posts.
[*]A Signal Logger records everything heard on its frequency. Anyone who finds it can read it.
[*]Scramblers and cipher cards keep a message for the people meant to read it.
[/list]

[h2]Sandbox[/h2]
Mast range bonus, masts need power, cipher cards, direction finding, beacon repeat and length, log size.

